== Trivia ==
*By completing all of '''Chantelle'''<nowiki>'</nowiki>s goals, players can earn up to {{Carnival Tokens|1200}} and {{Item|Carnival Ticket|amount=75}}s every time the {{yellow|Chivalrous Carnival}} event takes place.
*The amount of {{Carnival Tokens}} is increased by [[Party Equipment]].

